\item \code{within}: \eqn{\sum_S p_{j0} \Delta z_j}{sum_S p_j0 dz_j}, the change within species;
\item \code{covariance}: \eqn{\sum_S \Delta p_j \Delta z_j}{sum_S dp_j dz_j}, positive when the
species that increased are those whose trait changed in the same direction as the mean.
